milf.quest.magic_step_i.ascent_spawner_u:
The second <keyword>tier rune</keyword> - a <property>solid</property> improvement.

Sets the spawner's core stats <property>directly</property>:
- spawn delay: <positive>100-400</positive> ticks;
- mobs per spawn: <positive>10</positive>;
- max nearby mobs: <positive>18</positive>;
- activation range: <positive>32</positive> blocks.

Hold the rune and press <property>RMB</property> on a <keyword>Mob Spawner</keyword> - the rune is consumed. Tier runes <warning>cannot be reversed</warning>.

